: There is lore in this industry and you appear to have the inside stroke.
: 
: Did Gary Kimball (Digital Research/CPM) stand up IBM on a biz meeting to
: take his girl friend flying and piss them off to the point that they
: flew up to Bill Gates (Microsoft/MSDOS) and inked a deal that that made
