Those jacks you see are called Modified Modular Jacks.

All the VT420's I have used came with a cable that plugs into the MMJ and 
a DB25 recepticle that connects to the cable.  If you can't find the ones that
came with your VT420, you'll have to go to DEC to buy them.  Your local
DEC hardware broker may have some also.



