The fact is, even a PC-XT is perfectly adequate for bog standard
WP/Spreadsheet/database work: I have MS Works 2.0 on a 7MHz PC-XT and it
runs plenty fast enough. With a faster machine you just get the same
sort of apps, *running at the same speed*, only they're in WYSIWYG, or
