:Larger disks work but are only recognized as DKX000 and not RZXX

   Disks larger than 1.073 GB are not supported as the system disk
   on any member of the VAXstation 3100 series -- with good reason.

   This is a limit of the console boot driver in the console ROM.
   This boot driver is used for bootstraps, and for system crashes.

   Do not configure a local SCSI system disk larger than 1.073 GB on
   any member of the VAXstation 3100 series.  Disk data corruptions
   can occur if this limit is exceeded.

