about 30" square, 62" tall, and has more steel in it than a M-1 tank.
*Very* solid unit. No RGB connectors, but has a console terminal (the
LetterWriter 100 died in a fall) and Ethernet connector, as well as
eight serial ports, a sync port, and a printer port. Wonder if I can
rewire the DEBNT driving the TK into a second Ethernet port? (As if
