In article <864042047.4996@dejanews.com>, christopher_bainbridge@derwentside.ac.uk writes:
:Does anyone have a diagram of the lead to boot a dec micro vax 3100 with...

   Which specific "dec micro vax 3100"?  (There are MicroVAX 3100
   series boxes, and VAXstation 3100 series boxes, and there are
   various differences within each series.)

:...a vt420 terminal? The one that connects the printer port to comm1 i
:think. 

   The DECconnect MMJ pinout is in the OpenVMS Frequently Asked Questions
   (FAQ) posting.  As are the various DECconnect adapter part numbers for
   the most commonly used DECconnect adapters.

:Do I put the switch next to the port up or down?

   If the <BREAK> key gets you to the >>> when pressed, you have the S3
   switch set the right way.  The alternate console switch (S3) is usually
   "up" for most alternate consoles, and the console is connected via the
   printer MMJ port.  9600 baud.  (All this may be system dependent...)

:What do the status lights mean when the system is booting up?

   The LEDs indicate which part of the hardware diagnostics are running.

