Of course you can. Preferably frome one with 512 Byte/block although 
I have seen some these Machines booting from 2048 Byte/block CD-Roms
(seems to depend on the type of SCSI-Controller). Be sure you have 
the right external cable!

> 3) Is there any Free UN*X System running on a 3100 (I am very
> disapointed because NetBSD only runs on VAXstation 2000).
