in court what he meant when he said "There is nothing left to copy" is 
something any jury can understand.

2.  Intel's lack of quality control.  For the second time in 3 years they 
have a bug in the Floating Point Unit of the Pentium.  They are the only
chip maker I know in recent times that has had math bugs as bad as these.  
