>  I have a Digital Starion 910, model# Digital FR 901AA-A7.  My motherboard
> only has one RAM expansion slot, and I need to know what type of 16mg RAM
> chip will work with my system.  What type of chip do I need?  Is there any
> setup program I can run to find out?

The Starion 910 originally shipped with 8MB of DRAM. The 8MB was
integrated on the main logic board and contains of 8MB of 70ns,
non-parity DRAM. In addition there are two (2) SIMM expansion slots that
accept two, 72 pin, 70ns, non-parity SIMMs.

Check you're User Guide, page 4-14, for information on type of memory
and instructions for installing.

