    Installing memory cards on a 780 involved the following procedure:

	1.) shut down system
	2.) open front door
	3.) release bar at top of card cage
	4.) slide plastic airflow barrier out of the way
	5.) pop out airflow card from memory slot
	6.) pop in memory card
	7.) replace airflow barrier, latch bar, close door, restart system

