     The ZLXp-E1 supports MANY (up to 15 as I remember) different scan
rates, including the 1024x864x60Hz that the VR297 is.  The reason for the no
sync is that the VR297 wants sync on Green, and you can achieve that by setting
a console variable (tga_sync? - I don't have the manual with me, but it's
in the manual for your workstation, in the part that describes the console).
I have a ZLXp-E1 on an Alphastation 200 4/233 with a VRT19-DA (1280x1024x66Hz)
and I had to set it and turn the knob on the board for the correct scan
setting, but after that it's fine.

