> alpha nt4 Vs intel nt4
> 
> we are running a 16 bit application on an alpha 4/266 and find that
> it is 3 times slower than on an intel p166.
> 
> Why....? can we run it any faster ??

It's because 16 bit intel application runs in emulation. 
16 bit app works  in two submachines: intel on alpha, and 16-bit in
32-bit OS.
32 bit Intel apps can run with FX!32 translation and go slower than
native alpha code.


